Hello,

In this code :

  for(i = 0; i < Rf_length(cmdexpr); i++)
       ans = Rf_eval(VECTOR_ELT(cmdexpr, i), R_GlobalEnv);
     UNPROTECT(2);

I'd advise you to use R_tryEval. This is how JRI does it.

Furthermore, you don't need to eval each expression, you can evaluate 
the expression vector.

Romain


