The point is that both of the above are wrong. Such code is never  
guaranteed to work. java.parameters are global settings that you  
should setup in your environment. It is not a business of any function  
to set them - it's a user setting -- which is why it has nothing to do  
with the R-devel discussion.

Cheers,
Simon




